*> Implementation test of the chat and command packets of proto/src/chat-commands.cob: Command
*> Suggestion request (05c 0x0F), Command Suggestions (05a 0x0F), Chat Command (05c 0x07), the
*> ChatTypeBound composite, Player Chat (05a 0x42) and Disguised Chat (05a 0x21) with the standard chat
*> types. A writer that cannot encode a value appends nothing and sets PB-ERROR; a failed read leaves
*> PB-POS where it was and yields an all-zero value. Expected bytes are written out by hand from the
*> field tables of the documents, not taken from the encoder.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-CHAT-COMMANDS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY PBCHAT.
 COPY PBCHAT REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==PK-==.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-HEX                 PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-EXPECT              PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(120).
 01 WS-EDIT                PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CUT                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FULL                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BAD                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OFFSET              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-COUNT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SAME                PIC X(40).
 01 WS-TRANS               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CAP                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 256.
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(256).
 01 WS-BIG                 PIC X(40000) VALUE ALL "a".
 01 WS-EMOJI               PIC X(4).
 01 WS-BYTE                PIC X.
 COPY PBCHAT REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==WS-ZERO-==.
 01 WS-ALICE               PIC X(18) VALUE "08 0005 416c696365".
 01 WS-BOB                 PIC X(14) VALUE "08 0003 426f62".
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     MOVE FUNCTION HEX-TO-CHAR("F09F9880") TO WS-EMOJI
     PERFORM REQUEST-CASES
     PERFORM CHAT-COMMAND-CASES
     PERFORM SUGGESTIONS-CASES
     PERFORM BOUND-CASES
     PERFORM DISGUISED-CASES
     PERFORM PLAYER-CHAT-CASES
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PB-BUFFER
     STOP RUN.

*> ---- Command Suggestion request (05c 0x0F): VarInt transaction id, String(32500) ----
 REQUEST-CASES.
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     MOVE 300 TO WS-TRANS
     MOVE "/gamemode c" TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE 11 TO WS-LEN
     CALL "PB-PUT-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-TEXT WS-LEN
     MOVE "suggestion request 300 /gamemode c" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "ac02 0b 2f67616d656d6f646520 63" TO WS-EXPECT
     PERFORM CHECK-BYTES
     MOVE 0 TO WS-TRANS WS-LEN
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-TEXT
     CALL "PB-GET-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-TEXT WS-CAP WS-LEN
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
     MOVE WS-TRANS TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     MOVE WS-LEN TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     STRING " " WS-TEXT(1:WS-LEN) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     MOVE "suggestion request 300 /gamemode c reads back" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "300 11 /gamemode c" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-FIELDS
*>   An empty text is a zero length.
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     MOVE 0 TO WS-TRANS WS-LEN
     CALL "PB-PUT-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-TEXT WS-LEN
     MOVE "suggestion request 0 empty text" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "00 00" TO WS-EXPECT
     PERFORM CHECK-BYTES
*>   32500 UTF-16 code units are the most; 16250 emoji are 32500 units in 65000 bytes.
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     MOVE 1 TO WS-TRANS
     MOVE 32500 TO WS-LEN
     CALL "PB-PUT-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-BIG WS-LEN
     MOVE "suggestion request of 32500 characters is accepted" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 32504 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = PB-LENGTH + PB-ERROR * 100000
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     MOVE 32501 TO WS-LEN
     CALL "PB-PUT-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-BIG WS-LEN
     MOVE "suggestion request of 32501 characters" TO WS-NAME
     PERFORM PUT-ERROR
     MOVE -1 TO WS-LEN
     CALL "PB-PUT-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-BIG WS-LEN
     MOVE "suggestion request of length -1" TO WS-NAME
     PERFORM PUT-ERROR
     MOVE 5 TO WS-LEN
     MOVE -1 TO WS-TRANS
     CALL "PB-PUT-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-BIG WS-LEN
     MOVE "suggestion request of transaction id -1" TO WS-NAME
     PERFORM PUT-ERROR
     MOVE "suggestion request with no bytes" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-HEX
     MOVE 77 TO WS-TRANS
     MOVE 77 TO WS-LEN
     CALL "TEST-FILL-HEX" USING WS-HEX PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-GET-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-TEXT WS-CAP WS-LEN
     PERFORM CHECK-REQUEST-ERROR
     MOVE "suggestion request with a cut text" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "01 05 6162" TO WS-HEX
     CALL "TEST-FILL-HEX" USING WS-HEX PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-GET-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-TEXT WS-CAP WS-LEN
     PERFORM CHECK-REQUEST-ERROR
     MOVE "suggestion request with a negative transaction id" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "ffffffff0f 01 61" TO WS-HEX
     CALL "TEST-FILL-HEX" USING WS-HEX PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-GET-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-TEXT WS-CAP WS-LEN
     PERFORM CHECK-REQUEST-ERROR
     MOVE "suggestion request longer than the caller's capacity" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "01 05 6162636465" TO WS-HEX
     CALL "TEST-FILL-HEX" USING WS-HEX PB-BUFFER
     MOVE 4 TO WS-CAP
     CALL "PB-GET-SUGGESTION-REQUEST" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TRANS WS-TEXT WS-CAP WS-LEN
     MOVE 256 TO WS-CAP
     PERFORM CHECK-REQUEST-ERROR.

*> PB-ERROR 1, PB-POS 0, transaction id and length 0.
 CHECK-REQUEST-ERROR.
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "test chat commands get of " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NAME)
         " sets PB-ERROR, keeps PB-POS and yields zeros" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 1000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = PB-ERROR * 1000 + PB-POS * 100 + WS-TRANS + WS-LEN
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.

*> ---- Chat Command (05c 0x07): String(32767) ----
 CHAT-COMMAND-CASES.
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     MOVE "gamemode c" TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE 10 TO WS-LEN
     CALL "PB-PUT-CHAT-COMMAND" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TEXT WS-LEN
     MOVE "chat command gamemode c" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "0a 67616d656d6f64652063" TO WS-EXPECT
     PERFORM CHECK-BYTES
     MOVE 0 TO WS-LEN
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-TEXT
     CALL "PB-GET-CHAT-COMMAND" USING PB-BUFFER WS-TEXT WS-CAP WS-LEN
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
