*>   The 128 entries a response can hold: 5 header bytes and 3 bytes an entry.
     INITIALIZE PB-SUGGESTIONS
     MOVE 1 TO PB-SG-TRANSACTION
     MOVE 1 TO PB-SG-LENGTH
     MOVE 128 TO PB-SG-COUNT
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 128
         MOVE 1 TO PB-SG-TEXT-LENGTH(WS-I)
         MOVE "x" TO PB-SG-TEXT(WS-I)
         MOVE -1 TO PB-SG-TOOLTIP-KIND(WS-I)
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-SUGGESTIONS" USING PB-BUFFER PB-SUGGESTIONS
     MOVE "suggestions of 128 entries" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 389 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = PB-LENGTH + PB-ERROR * 100000
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     PERFORM SUGGESTIONS-READ-BACK
